WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.850
Standing light punch begins the light target.

2
00:00:00.850 --> 00:00:01.250
The light-kick target follow-up hits Ryu.

3
00:00:01.250 --> 00:00:01.650
The medium-punch follow-up completes the target.

4
00:00:01.650 --> 00:00:02.150
Light Swagger Step links the target to Super.

5
00:00:02.150 --> 00:00:04.050
Jamie activates Level 3 from light Palm.

6
00:00:04.050 --> 00:00:05.400
The Level 3 cinematic continues.

7
00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:06.350
Ryu is knocked down after Level 3 without a juggle extension.
